---
// src/pages/index.astro
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="KTAJ - Keep Talking About Jesus. A Christian ministry sharing the gospel through media, community, and Christ-centered content. Join us in worship, prayer, and fellowship." />
    <title>KTAJ - Keep Talking About Jesus</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body>
    
    <header class="hero">
      <nav>
        <a href="#" class="logo">
           <img src="/ktaj-logo.png" alt="KTAJ Logo" class="nav-logo">
        </a>

        <button class="hamburger" aria-label="Toggle navigation menu" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="bar"></span>
          <span class="bar"></span>
          <span class="bar"></span>
        </button>

        <div class="links">
          <a href="#">Home</a>
          <a href="#about">About</a>
          <a href="#connect">Connect</a>
          <a href="#merch">Merch</a>
          <a href="#prayer">Prayer</a>
          <a href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?business=Ktajministries@gmail.com&currency_code=USD" target="_blank" class="donate-btn">Donate</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>KEEP TALKING<br>ABOUT JESUS</h1>
        <p>Sharing the gospel through media and community.</p>
        <a href="#connect" class="btn">Join the Community</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section id="daily-verse" style="background: #111; color: white; padding: 4rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #333; text-align: center;">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 style="color: #ffd700; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-transform: uppercase;">Scripture of the Day</h2>
        
        <blockquote style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-style: italic; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.6; color: #ccc;">
          "<span id="verse-text">Loading today's word...</span>"
        </blockquote>
        
        <p id="verse-reference" style="margin-top: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fe2c55; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">
          </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="section-white">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p class="subtitle">"Our desire is simple: to know Christ, to make Him known, and to stand unwavering in the truth."</p>
        
        <div class="foundation-text">
            <p>We stand firmly on the truth of the Holy Bible as the inspired and authoritative Word of God, delivered to us through the apostles and preserved for all generations. Scripture is our foundation, our guide, and the final authority for faith and life.</p>
         </div>

        <div class="video-container">
            <iframe 
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/wrDuymK0CMc" 
                title="KTAJ Ministry Video" 
                frameborder="0" 
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
                allowfullscreen>
            </iframe>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          
          <div class="card">
            <h3>God the Father</h3>
            <p>We believe that every good and perfect gift comes from the Lord our God, who is holy, righteous, and unchanging. All glory belongs to Him alone.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Jesus Christ</h3>
            <p>We believe that Jesus Christ is the only begotten Son of God, fully God and fully man, sent by the Father out of love for the world. Through Him alone there is reconciliation with God.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Salvation</h3>
            <p>Salvation is found only in Jesus Christ. Through His death, burial, and resurrection, eternal life is made available to all who believe—not by works or tradition, but by God’s grace through faith.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>The Return</h3>
            <p>We believe that Jesus will return for His bride—the Church. We live in expectation of His return, striving to walk faithfully, obediently, and humbly before Him.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Christian Living</h3>
            <p>We believe in living out our faith daily through prayer, repentance, obedience, and love for one another. We seek to follow Christ not only in word, but in action.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="connect" class="section-dark">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Connect With Us</h2>
        <p>Catch us live on TikTok and join the conversation.</p>
        <div class="social-buttons">
          <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@_wyldeman_" target="_blank" class="social-btn tiktok">Follow on TikTok</a>
          
          <a href="https://discord.gg/JzZdKn8KHy" target="_blank" class="social-btn discord">Join our Discord</a>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ktajministries" target="_blank" class="social-btn instagram">Instagram</a>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ktajministries" target="_blank" class="social-btn youtube">YouTube</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="merch" class="section-white">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Official Merch</h2>
        <p class="subtitle">Support the ministry and wear the message.</p>
        
        <div class="grid">

          <div class="merch-card">
            <img src="/shirt.jpg" alt="KTAJ Let Your Light Shine Tee - white t-shirt with KTAJ design" class="merch-img">
            <h3>KTAJ Let Your Light Shine Tee</h3>
            <p class="price">$30.99</p>
            <span class="btn-small coming-soon">Coming Soon</span>
          </div>

          <div class="merch-card">
            <img src="/hoodie.jpg" alt="Prayer Warrior Hoodie - black hoodie with Prayer Warrior design" class="merch-img">
            <h3>Prayer Warrior Hoodie</h3>
            <p class="price">$30.99</p>
            <span class="btn-small coming-soon">Coming Soon</span>
          </div>

          <div class="merch-card">
            <img src="/cap.jpg" alt="KTAJ Ministry Cap - black cap with KTAJ logo" class="merch-img">
            <h3>KTAJ Ministry Cap</h3>
            <p class="price">$30.99</p>
            <span class="btn-small coming-soon">Coming Soon</span>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 3rem;">
            <p class="subtitle" style="margin-bottom: 0;">Full store launching soon — stay connected for updates!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="prayer" class="section-gray">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Prayer Requests</h2>
        <p class="subtitle">How can we pray for you today?</p>
        
        <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" class="contact-form">
          
          <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="cc58be17-3873-4112-ad9b-036d2d906a12">
          <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="https://ktaj-website.vercel.app/">

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="prayer-name" class="sr-only">Your Name (Optional)</label>
            <input type="text" id="prayer-name" name="name" placeholder="Your Name (Optional)">
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="prayer-email" class="sr-only">Your Email (Optional)</label>
            <input type="email" id="prayer-email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email (Optional)">
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="prayer-message" class="sr-only">Your Prayer Request</label>
            <textarea id="prayer-message" name="message" required placeholder="Type your prayer request here..."></textarea>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Send Request</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2026 Keep Talking About Jesus Ministry. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

    <script is:inline>
      // Daily scripture fetch
      fetch('https://beta.ourmanna.com/api/v1/get/?format=json&order=daily')
        .then(response => response.json())
        .then(data => {
          document.getElementById('verse-text').innerText = data.verse.details.text;
          document.getElementById('verse-reference').innerText = data.verse.details.reference;
        })
        .catch(error => {
          console.error('Error fetching verse:', error);
          document.getElementById('verse-text').innerText = "For God so loved the world that he gave his one and only Son, that whoever believes in him shall not perish but have eternal life.";
          document.getElementById('verse-reference').innerText = "John 3:16";
        });

      // Mobile hamburger menu toggle
      const hamburger = document.querySelector('.hamburger');
      const links = document.querySelector('.links');

      hamburger.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const isOpen = links.classList.toggle('open');
        hamburger.classList.toggle('active');
        hamburger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', isOpen);
      });

      // Close menu when a nav link is clicked
      links.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link => {
        link.addEventListener('click', () => {
          links.classList.remove('open');
          hamburger.classList.remove('active');
          hamburger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
        });
      });
    </script>
    
   <style>
      /* 1. Global Reset & Box Sizing */
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }

      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

      body {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        color: #333;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      /* Screen-reader only utility */
      .sr-only {
        position: absolute;
        width: 1px;
        height: 1px;
        padding: 0;
        margin: -1px;
        overflow: hidden;
        clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
        white-space: nowrap;
        border: 0;
      }

      /* 2. Hero Section */
      .hero {
        background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)), url('/bg.jpg');
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center;
        height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        color: white;
      }

      nav {
        padding: 2rem 3rem;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .nav-logo {
        height: 60px;
        width: auto;
        display: block;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));
      }

      .logo {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      /* Hamburger menu button - hidden on desktop */
      .hamburger {
        display: none;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 5px;
        background: none;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        padding: 8px;
        z-index: 10;
      }

      .hamburger .bar {
        display: block;
        width: 28px;
        height: 3px;
        background: white;
        border-radius: 2px;
        transition: transform 0.3s, opacity 0.3s;
      }

      .hamburger.active .bar:nth-child(1) {
        transform: translateY(8px) rotate(45deg);
      }
      .hamburger.active .bar:nth-child(2) {
        opacity: 0;
      }
      .hamburger.active .bar:nth-child(3) {
        transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(-45deg);
      }

      /* Navigation links */
      .links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        margin-left: auto;
      }

      .links a {
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
        text-decoration: none;
        margin-left: 30px;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .links a:hover { color: white; }

      .hero-content {
        flex-grow: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 1rem;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .hero-content h1 {
        font-size: 4.5rem;
        line-height: 1;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: -2px;
        text-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      }

      .hero-content p {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      }

      /* 3. General Section Styles */
      .section-white { background: white; color: #111; padding: 5rem 1rem; }
      .section-dark { background: #111; color: white; padding: 5rem 1rem; }
      .section-gray { background: #f4f4f4; color: #111; padding: 5rem 1rem; }

      .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; width: 100%; }

      h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -1px; }
      .subtitle { font-size: 1.2rem; color: #666; margin-bottom: 3rem; }

      /* 4. Grid Layout */
      .foundation-text {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .card { padding: 2rem; background: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 8px; }
      .card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #000; }
      .card p { line-height: 1.6; color: #444; }

      /* VIDEO CONTAINER */
      .video-container {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 2rem auto;
        padding-bottom: 56.25%;
        height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        background: #000;
      }
      .video-container iframe {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
      }

      /* 5. Buttons */
      .btn {
        background: white; color: black; padding: 16px 32px;
        text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 50px;
        text-transform: uppercase; transition: transform 0.2s; display: inline-block;
      }
      .btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }

      .social-buttons { margin-top: 2rem; display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .social-btn {
        padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;
      }

      .tiktok { background: #fe2c55; color: white; }
      .discord { background: #5865F2; color: white; }

      .instagram {
        background: linear-gradient(45deg, #f09433 0%, #e6683c 25%, #dc2743 50%, #cc2366 75%, #bc1888 100%);
        color: white;
      }
      .youtube {
        background: #FF0000;
        color: white;
      }

      /* 6. Form Styles */
      .contact-form {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .contact-form input,
      .contact-form textarea {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 1rem;
        border: 1px solid #ccc;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-family: inherit;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .contact-form textarea {
        min-height: 150px;
        resize: vertical;
      }

      .btn-submit {
        background: #111;
        color: white;
        border: none;
        padding: 1rem 2rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        border-radius: 50px;
        cursor: pointer;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        align-self: center;
        transition: background 0.2s;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 200px;
      }
      .btn-submit:hover { background: #333; }

      /* Footer */
      footer { background: #000; color: #666; text-align: center; padding: 2rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }

      /* Merch Styles */
      .merch-card {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 1rem;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
      }
      .merch-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); }

      .merch-img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 250px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        background: #f0f0f0;
      }

      .price {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #fe2c55;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 0;
      }

      .btn-small {
        background: #111;
        color: white;
        padding: 8px 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        border-radius: 4px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        display: inline-block;
      }
      .btn-small:hover { background: #444; }

      .coming-soon {
        background: #555;
        cursor: default;
      }
      .coming-soon:hover { background: #555; }

      /* Donate Button Style */
      .donate-btn {
        background-color: #0070ba;
        color: white !important;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        border-radius: 50px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
      }

      .donate-btn:hover {
        background-color: #005ea6;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      /* --- MOBILE RESPONSIVENESS --- */
      @media (max-width: 768px) {

        nav {
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
        }

        .hamburger {
          display: flex;
        }

        .links {
          display: none;
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: center;
          gap: 15px;
          width: 100%;
          margin-left: 0;
          padding-top: 1rem;
        }

        .links.open {
          display: flex;
        }

        .links a { margin-left: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .donate-btn { width: 100%; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; }

        .social-buttons {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: center;
          width: 100%;
        }

        .social-btn {
          width: 100%;
          max-width: 300px;
          text-align: center;
          margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .hero-content h1 { font-size: 3rem; }
        .grid { text-align: center; }
      }
</style>
  </body>
</html>